# tools/omarchy-trusted.fpr — fingerprints of the Omarchy signing keys we
# accept, one per line. tools/repack-omarchy refuses to run when the
# downloaded omarchy-keyring trusts any key not listed here, so a key change
# upstream fails loudly instead of being taken on trust from the package that
# carries it. Checked on 2026-10-28 against omarchy-keyring 20251027-1
# ("Omarchy <pkgs@omarchy.org>").
